    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ng'asheesu ghaayiinyi ghuuta haw uurji dea eemeeda saang'a aba humng'eeda, nea gwayi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ghweelmeeda nyeangiida Dayeenda Gisilleanda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwarina ghuuta nyaasha jeedeaba hoorgeedida bea gheambalmeedean nea gwayi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeeshean malaykajeanda, “Ng'oara ng'asheesu: Ghang'wana fugiga siguursa hamita geeshooda Dayeenda Gisilleandean.” Ak gwayeeshiinean, “Suh ng'asheega huumwa bea ASEETA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geabeedeaysi madeeda geeshangaaschi ak ghaaghadoawanyi niny hean gwayeeshiinean, “Adiidu gisini ng'asheesu! Aniini geawooschi soomjeanda sea ang'iing'i sea fuga iduupcheewi mideawa muuwuunooda Yesu. Ghadoawana ASEETA.” Aba gideaba muuwuunooda Yesu guroorooda sibaneanduumeeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Siida mida uhuuda Faraaseeda eesh",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghaadaayi nea ghwajaada humng'eeda, ak ghaadaayi, faraaseedeesh! Nea gwanda badaydaanyi siida siguura Doobiiwnata ea Huumwa, ak niny aba doobiiwnata goorgweaksa nea gwasin ng'ucheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gheanyangaaschi gawuurji ng'ushapta beasta, ak uhuudaanyi gwanda shiipka saang'a; ak gheawunga sing'waar mwanala eara sih geaghus niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak niny ea siikwealsa hang'da sing'uda foojeanda, ak gheawungaaschi geeguura Ng'asheanda ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ghwaat geeshta lugooda humng'eeda, nea gookwa hang'weaka bumbuni, eashish nea miyaas, ak ghwaat geeshta faraasajeega eeshish. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwarina ng'uta ng'aniip ghuutaanyi jea ghabwara eemoojiga, ak gayghoahaaghwiida saawa bileangida gharinyeanda; nea niny ghoalaapta ng'eanyi shoomanda difaayeeda bea nyarasta haw bea ASEETA Hoauur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak badayda hang'daanyi ea gibeestaanyi geeng'oorsa, gheawunga Sugoocheanda sugoodiga ea Ng'utamiida ng'utamoojiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghaadaayi malaykajeanda nea ghamiinaada aba badayda aseeta, nea goojuur aba ghuuta haw nea gwayeesha dariidaka ng'eatng'eata aba bugusta humng'eeda, “Apkaani, aghadoawana geat aba ghweelmeeda haw bea ASEETA, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghoayaaji sasanuuka sugoodiga, ea sasanuuka shirikarajeega hees, ea sasanuuka fuga mideawa uurjeenga, ea sasanuuka faraasajeega ea gea fuga ding'da, ea sasanuuka buuneesean, sea siida abal geaw ea giing'oonyaneeda, dea mwanang' ea dea haw.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghaadaayi diyeayda ea sugoodiga ng'eanyiida ea shirikarajeega nyaawa nea ghabwat geat nea gagasa gang'uchi sea siidida apteada aba badayda faraasiin sea shirikareadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geang'waay diyeaydida, sea sibaneeda ng'uyeega ghayi sina gwadeagwajeega aba madeadaanyi, ak gwareengani fugiga ghayi niing'waay giirooraneedeaba diyeaydida ea fugiga ghadoawan gidasiratiida ninyiin. Hean geejaksa suh asiyeenyean jeeda basooda beasta nea majeekcheewi ak ghwaak beasta ea giikayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak giika siipuudiin geenuuseadawa ng'uteaba siidida apteada aba badayda faraasiin, aba ng'uta rinna ghuutaanyi; hean gwalang'u dariidaka sean aba banyeega nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
